<!doctype html>
<html lang="<%= nodefony.locale || "fr" %>">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <meta http-equiv="content-type" content="text/html; charset=UTF-8" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1" />
    <meta name="generator" content="Nodefony (https://nodefony.net)" />
    <meta
      name="description"
      content="Nodefony — le framework Node.js fullstack : temps réel natif, développement agentic-ready, sur un socle TypeScript isomorphe."
    />
    <title><%= nodefony.name %> — framework Node.js fullstack</title>
    <style>
      /* ─── Design tokens — les 3 couleurs du logo Nodefony ─────────────── */
      :root {
        --blue: #096bbf;
        --cyan: #1ea0ec;
        --green: #4a8b3e;
        --bg: #fafbfd;
        --bg-soft: #f1f5fa;
        --fg: #0e1726;
        --muted: #5b6b84;
        --card: #ffffff;
        --border: #e3e9f2;
        --code-bg: #0e1726;
        --code-fg: #d9e6f5;
        --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(14, 23, 38, 0.05), 0 8px 24px rgba(14, 23, 38, 0.06);
        --shadow-hover: 0 2px 4px rgba(14, 23, 38, 0.06), 0 14px 34px rgba(9, 107, 191, 0.14);
      }
      @media (prefers-color-scheme: dark) {
        :root {
          --bg: #0a0f1c;
          --bg-soft: #0e1524;
          --fg: #e8edf6;
          --muted: #93a1ba;
          --card: #111828;
          --border: #223046;
          --code-bg: #0b1220;
          --code-fg: #cfe0f2;
          --shadow: 0 1px 2px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 8px 24px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.35);
          --shadow-hover: 0 2px 4px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.3), 0 14px 34px rgba(30, 160, 236, 0.18);
        }
      }
      * { box-sizing: border-box; }
      html { scroll-behavior: smooth; scroll-padding-top: 76px; }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: reduce) { html { scroll-behavior: auto; } }
      body {
        margin: 0;
        font-family: ui-sans-serif, system-ui, -apple-system, "Segoe UI", Roboto, Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif;
        color: var(--fg);
        background:
          radial-gradient(1100px 480px at 50% -14%, rgba(9, 107, 191, 0.07), transparent 60%),
          var(--bg);
        line-height: 1.6;
        -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;
      }
      a { color: var(--blue); }
      a:focus-visible, button:focus-visible {
        outline: 2px solid var(--cyan);
        outline-offset: 3px;
        border-radius: 4px;
      }

      /* ─── Topbar ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .topbar {
        position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 20;
        display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 18px;
        padding: 12px clamp(18px, 4vw, 40px);
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 78%, transparent);
        backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(12px);
        border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
      }
      .brand { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--fg); font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
      .brand img { height: 30px; width: auto; }
      .brand .v {
        font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted);
        border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px; padding: 1px 9px;
      }
      .topnav { margin-left: auto; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 4px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .topnav a {
        text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;
        padding: 7px 12px; border-radius: 8px; transition: color 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
      }
      .topnav a:hover { color: var(--fg); background: var(--bg-soft); }
      .topnav a.gh { color: var(--fg); border: 1px solid var(--border); display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 7px; }
      .topnav a.gh svg { height: 16px; width: 16px; }

      main { max-width: 1080px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 clamp(18px, 4vw, 40px) 40px; }

      /* ─── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .hero { text-align: center; padding: clamp(56px, 9vw, 96px) 0 clamp(40px, 6vw, 64px); }
      .hero img.logo { height: 80px; width: auto; }
      .hero h1 {
        margin: 20px auto 10px; max-width: 900px;
        font-size: clamp(2.1rem, 5vw, 3.4rem); line-height: 1.12; letter-spacing: -0.028em;
      }
      .hero .sub {
        color: var(--fg); opacity: 0.82; font-size: clamp(1rem, 2vw, 1.2rem);
        font-weight: 500; margin: 0 auto 10px; max-width: 720px;
      }
      .hero .sig { color: var(--muted); font-size: 1rem; max-width: 640px; margin: 0 auto; }
      .badges { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px; justify-content: center; margin: 22px 0 0; }
      .badge {
        font-size: 0.76rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--muted);
        border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--card);
        border-radius: 999px; padding: 4px 12px;
      }
      .badge.agentic { color: var(--green); border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 45%, var(--border)); }
      .install {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px; margin: 26px auto 0;
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
        font-size: 0.95rem; color: var(--code-fg); background: var(--code-bg);
        border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 13px 22px;
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }
      .install .p { color: var(--cyan); user-select: none; }
      .cta { display: flex; gap: 12px; justify-content: center; flex-wrap: wrap; margin-top: 26px; }
      .btn {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-decoration: none;
        font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.95rem; border-radius: 10px; padding: 11px 22px;
        transition: transform 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease;
      }
      .btn.primary { color: #fff; background: var(--blue); box-shadow: 0 4px 14px rgba(9, 107, 191, 0.25); }
      .btn.primary:hover { background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--blue) 88%, #000); }
      .btn.ghost { color: var(--fg); border: 1px solid var(--border); background: var(--card); }
      .btn.ghost:hover { border-color: var(--cyan); }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .btn:hover { transform: translateY(-2px); } }

      /* ─── Sections ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      section { padding: clamp(34px, 5vw, 54px) 0; }
      .sec-head { max-width: 720px; margin: 0 0 28px; }
      .kicker {
        text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.16em; font-size: 0.72rem;
        font-weight: 700; color: var(--accent, var(--blue)); margin: 0 0 8px;
      }
      .sec-head h2 { margin: 0 0 8px; font-size: clamp(1.4rem, 2.8vw, 1.9rem); letter-spacing: -0.02em; }
      .sec-head p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); }

      .grid { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(280px, 1fr)); }
      .feature {
        background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 22px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }
      .feature .ic {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
        height: 40px; width: 40px; border-radius: 10px;
        color: var(--accent, var(--blue));
        background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent, var(--blue)) 12%, transparent);
      }
      .feature .ic svg { height: 22px; width: 22px; }
      .feature h3 { margin: 14px 0 6px; font-size: 1.05rem; letter-spacing: -0.01em; }
      .feature p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.9rem; }

      /* ─── Agentic ready ────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      .agentic-panel {
        border: 1px solid color-mix(in srgb, var(--green) 34%, var(--border));
        border-radius: 18px; padding: clamp(24px, 4vw, 40px);
        background:
          radial-gradient(560px 280px at 12% 0%, rgba(74, 139, 62, 0.05), transparent 60%),
          var(--card);
        box-shadow: var(--shadow);
      }
      .agentic-grid { display: grid; gap: 16px; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); margin-top: 22px; }
      .agentic-item { border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 12px; padding: 18px; background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--bg) 55%, transparent); }
      .agentic-item h3 { margin: 0 0 6px; font-size: 0.98rem; display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; }
      .agentic-item h3 svg { height: 17px; width: 17px; color: var(--green); flex: none; }
      .agentic-item p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }
      .agentic-item code {
        font-family: ui-monospace, SFMono-Regular, Menlo, Consolas, monospace;
        font-size: 0.82em; background: var(--bg-soft); border: 1px solid var(--border);
        border-radius: 6px; padding: 1px 6px;
      }
      .agentic-link { margin-top: 20px; font-size: 0.9rem; }
      .agentic-link a { font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
      .agentic-link a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }

      /* ─── Cartes lien (démos, studio) ──────────────────────────────────── */
      .card {
        display: block; text-decoration: none; color: var(--fg);
        background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 14px;
        padding: 20px; box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        transition: transform 0.15s ease, border-color 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.15s ease;
      }
      .card:hover { border-color: var(--accent, var(--cyan)); box-shadow: var(--shadow-hover); }
      @media (prefers-reduced-motion: no-preference) { .card:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); } }
      .card .ic { color: var(--accent, var(--blue)); display: inline-flex; height: 34px; align-items: center; }
      .card .ic svg, .card .ic img { height: 30px; width: 30px; }
      .card h3 { margin: 10px 0 4px; font-size: 1.08rem; }
      .card p { margin: 0; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.88rem; }
      .card .go { margin-top: 12px; font-size: 0.82rem; color: var(--accent, var(--blue)); font-weight: 600; }
      .card.wide { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 22px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
      .card.wide .body { flex: 1 1 320px; }
      .card.wide h3 { margin-top: 0; }

      /* ─── Footer ───────────────────────────────────────────────────────── */
      footer { border-top: 1px solid var(--border); margin-top: 30px; padding: 34px 0 10px; }
      .chips { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; }
      .chip {
        display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; text-decoration: none; color: var(--fg);
        background: var(--card); border: 1px solid var(--border); border-radius: 999px;
        padding: 7px 15px 7px 11px; font-size: 0.88rem;
        transition: border-color 0.15s ease;
      }
      .chip:hover { border-color: var(--accent, var(--cyan)); }
      .chip svg { height: 17px; width: 17px; color: var(--muted); transition: color 0.15s ease; }
      .chip:hover svg { color: var(--accent, var(--blue)); }
      .foot-note { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 8px 22px; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 26px; color: var(--muted); font-size: 0.85rem; }
      .foot-note a { color: var(--blue); text-decoration: none; }
      .foot-note a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
    </style>
  </head>

  <body>
    <header class="topbar">
      <a class="brand" href="/">
        <img src="/nodefony-logo.png" alt="" draggable="false" />
        <span><%= nodefony.name %></span>
        <span class="v">v<%= nodefony.version %></span>
      </a>
      <nav class="topnav" aria-label="Navigation principale">
        <a href="#fonctionnalites">Fonctionnalités</a>
        <a href="#agentic">Agentic</a>
        <a href="#demos">Démos</a>
        <a href="#studio">Studio</a>
        <a class="gh" href="https://github.com/nodefony/nodefony-core" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer noopener">
          <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="currentColor" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 .297c-6.63 0-12 5.373-12 12 0 5.303 3.438 9.8 8.205 11.385.6.113.82-.258.82-.577 0-.285-.01-1.04-.015-2.04-3.338.724-4.042-1.61-4.042-1.61C4.422 18.07 3.633 17.7 3.633 17.7c-1.087-.744.084-.729.084-.729 1.205.084 1.838 1.236 1.838 1.236 1.07 1.835 2.809 1.305 3.495.998.108-.776.417-1.305.76-1.605-2.665-.3-5.466-1.332-5.466-5.93 0-1.31.465-2.38 1.235-3.22-.135-.303-.54-1.523.105-3.176 0 0 1.005-.322 3.3 1.23.96-.267 1.98-.399 3-.405 1.02.006 2.04.138 3 .405 2.28-1.552 3.285-1.23 3.285-1.23.645 1.653.24 2.873.12 3.176.765.84 1.23 1.91 1.23 3.22 0 4.61-2.805 5.625-5.475 5.92.42.36.81 1.096.81 2.22 0 1.606-.015 2.896-.015 3.286 0 .315.21.69.825.57C20.565 22.092 24 17.592 24 12.297c0-6.627-5.373-12-12-12"/></svg>
          <span>GitHub</span>
        </a>
      </nav>
    </header>

    <main>
      <!-- ─── Hero ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <div class="hero">
        <img class="logo" src="/nodefony-logo.png" alt="Logo Nodefony" draggable="false" />
        <h1>Le framework Node.js fullstack</h1>
        <p class="sub">Temps réel natif&nbsp;· développement agentic-ready&nbsp;· socle TypeScript isomorphe</p>
        <p class="sig">Une action de contrôleur. Deux transports. La même session, la même sécurité, le même code.</p>
        <div class="badges">
          <span class="badge agentic">Agentic ready</span>
          <span class="badge">Node.js ≥ 24</span>
          <span class="badge">TypeScript strict</span>
          <span class="badge">ESM only</span>
          <span class="badge">Licence CeCILL-B</span>
        </div>
        <div class="install" role="img" aria-label="Commande d'installation : npx nodefony create app">
          <span class="p">$</span><span>npx nodefony create app</span>
        </div>
        <div class="cta">
          <a class="btn primary" href="/nodefony">Ouvrir Studio</a>
          <a class="btn ghost" href="#demos">Voir les démos</a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <!-- ─── Fonctionnalités ──────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <section id="fonctionnalites">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <p class="kicker">Fonctionnalités</p>
          <h2>Bâti sur les modules natifs de la plateforme</h2>
          <p><code>node:http</code>, <code>node:http2</code>, WebSocket — un noyau à injection de
             dépendances, un système de modules, un pare-feu applicatif.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid">
          <div class="feature">
            <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><polygon points="13 2 3 14 12 14 11 22 21 10 12 10 13 2"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Temps réel natif</h3>
            <p>Le WebSocket n'est pas un ajout&nbsp;: même pipeline, même table de routes, même
               sécurité que le HTTP. Hub realtime, fan-out cluster Redis.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/><path d="m9 12 2 2 4-4"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Sécurité par conception</h3>
            <p>Pare-feu applicatif par zones, Zero Trust, CSRF Fetch Metadata, conformité
               OWASP &amp; RFC, sessions hybrides, WebAuthn.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"/></svg></span>
            <h3>DI &amp; modules</h3>
            <p>Injection de dépendances par décorateurs TypeScript, modules autonomes,
               configuration validée au boot — une clé mal orthographiée ne passe pas.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><ellipse cx="12" cy="5" rx="9" ry="3"/><path d="M3 5v14c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3V5"/><path d="M3 12c0 1.66 4 3 9 3s9-1.34 9-3"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Persistance portable</h3>
            <p>ORM multi-dialecte — Drizzle par défaut (SQLite, PostgreSQL, MySQL), Mongoose
               pour le documentaire. Entités par décorateurs, migrations.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="m12 3-9 5 9 5 9-5-9-5z"/><path d="m3 13 9 5 9-5"/><path d="m3 18 9 5 9-5" opacity=".4"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Frontends Vite</h3>
            <p>Le framework pilote Vite&nbsp;: dev servers HMR en développement, bundles en
               production. React, Vue, Angular, Svelte — plusieurs par application.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="feature">
            <span class="ic"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M3 12h18M12 3c2.5 2.6 4 5.7 4 9s-1.5 6.4-4 9c-2.5-2.6-4-5.7-4-9s1.5-6.4 4-9z"/></svg></span>
            <h3>Socle isomorphe</h3>
            <p>Le même paquet s'importe côté serveur et côté navigateur — client temps réel,
               règles d'autorisation et types écrits une fois.</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ─── Agentic ready ────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <section id="agentic" style="--accent: var(--green)">
        <div class="agentic-panel">
          <div class="sec-head" style="margin-bottom: 0">
            <p class="kicker">Agentic ready</p>
            <h2>Un framework qui se décrit aux agents IA</h2>
            <p>Nodefony est conçu pour être développé <em>avec</em> un agent&nbsp;: l'outillage,
               la connaissance et l'introspection sont livrés avec le framework — pas à deviner.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="agentic-grid">
            <div class="agentic-item">
              <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 22s8-4 8-10V5l-8-3-8 3v7c0 6 8 10 8 10z"/></svg>Skills livrées par npm</h3>
              <p>Chaque paquet embarque ses skills agent (Claude Code, …) et
                 <code>nodefony ai:sync</code> les installe dans l'application — l'agent connaît
                 les conventions du framework dès le premier prompt.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="agentic-item">
              <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="3" y="5" width="18" height="14" rx="2"/><path d="M7 9h6M7 13h10"/></svg>Carte de visite machine-lisible</h3>
              <p>L'application se présente elle-même&nbsp;: routes montées, services, config
                 effective, générateurs disponibles — via la CLI (<code>nodefony card</code>)
                 et le devkit HTTP.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="agentic-item">
              <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="5" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="19" cy="6" r="2"/><circle cx="12" cy="18" r="2"/><path d="M7 7l4 9M17 7l-4 9"/></svg>Introspection &amp; graphe symbolique</h3>
              <p><code>nodefony inspect</code> et le graphe des symboles répondent sans ouvrir
                 les sources&nbsp;: qui étend quoi, quelles routes existent, d'où vient chaque
                 valeur de config.</p>
            </div>
            <div class="agentic-item">
              <h3><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><rect x="6" y="6" width="12" height="12" rx="2"/><path d="M9 2v2M15 2v2M9 20v2M15 20v2M2 9h2M2 15h2M20 9h2M20 15h2"/></svg>Couche IA en approche</h3>
              <p>Agents métier dans l'application&nbsp;: orchestration LLM, RAG, mémoire,
                 garde-fous — <code>@nodefony/agent</code> et sa constellation, sur la roadmap.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <p class="agentic-link">
            → Carte de visite&nbsp;: <code>npx nodefony card</code> en CLI, ou
            <a href="/nodefony/devkit/api/card">/nodefony/devkit/api/card</a>
            <span style="color: var(--muted)">(data plane admin — authentification requise&nbsp;:
            Zero Trust, même en développement)</span>
          </p>
        </div>
      </section>

      <!-- ─── Démos ────────────────────────────────────────────────────── -->
      <section id="demos">
        <div class="sec-head">
          <p class="kicker">Frontends de démo</p>
          <h2>Quatre frameworks, un seul serveur</h2>
          <p>Chaque module front est construit et servi par <code>@nodefony/frontend</code>
             (Vite + HMR), monté sur sa route.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="grid">
          <a class="card" style="--accent: #61dafb" href="/react/app">
